---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Reclaiming our lives from screens
ctas:
  - title: Trying to quit social media?
    description: Most advice is wrong or even counterproductive. I wrote the QuitUSM Book based on my own experience from struggling with it myself to quitting in one day - yes, really!
    icon: menu_book
    label: Read Now
    href: /book/
  - title: Want to be on your phone less?
    description: If you want to reduce your screen time or be less distracted by your phone, check out these effective tips you can use right away.
    icon: lightbulb
    label: Go to article
    href: /guides/tips/
  - title: Take the challenge
    description: Take the Unplug Challenge - no screens for 24 hours, just like how it used to be.
    icon: unplug
    label: Start challenge
    href: /unplug-challenge/
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__image" src="/images/home_banner_cropped.jpg" alt="" width="2090" height="768">
  <div class="hero__text container">
    <h1 class="hero__title">{{ site.name }}</h1>
    <p class="hero__tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container home">
  <p class="home__intro">
    QuitUSM aims to help anyone achieve freedom from unhealthy social media (USM). Our phones are useful tools, but many of us are controlled by our screens, rather than the other way around.
    <br><br>
    We give people practical tools to manage their relationship with screens and social media - tools that actually work. These include <a href="/book">The QuitUSM Book</a> and our guides.
  </p>

  <ul class="cta-list" role="list">
    {% for cta in ctas %}
    <li class="cta card">
      <div class="cta__body">
        <h2 class="cta__title">{{ cta.title }}</h2>
        <p class="cta__description">{{ cta.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% icon cta.icon, "cta__icon" %}
      {% if cta.href %}
      <a class="button cta__button" href="{{ cta.href }}">{{ cta.label }}</a>
      {% else %}
      <span class="button button--disabled cta__button" aria-disabled="true">{{ cta.label }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
